{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Preserve the execution-level combinator error contract**\n\n`getResult()` creates a plain `Error` from only the message, so this passes if the final execution error changes from `PromiseCombinatorError` to another type. The per-step assertions do not cover that contract. Restore the exact `execution.getError()` assertion while retaining the invocation-count tolerance.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs745rdC","finding_digest":"0602ca001bdf246ac8f4e455917122781217648ed2686ddc8f7617f67d8e6076","finding_id":"arf_v1_aybmuaa334sgvshu4rkzc4jcpa","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-examples/src/examples/promise/any/promise-any.test.ts::failure-case::final-error-type-coverage","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-examples/src/examples/promise/any/promise-any.test.ts::failure-case::final-error-type-coverage","line":41,"observation_digest":"548982567ae128a27f56cf342398ea73ac125479b83d978a2470df27f97604a2","observation_id":"aro_v1_kseyevt24euke72wz42chghkoo","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-examples/src/examples/promise/any/promise-any.test.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_aybmuaa334sgvshu4rkzc4jcpa","published_at":"2026-10-04T02:40:35Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ugldfoxebe3lneh5mfvobtkr6z","reviewed_base_sha":"cc7db9bacb23278c58aecf16821737ba47797152","reviewed_head_sha":"1895cf2ee00117dda0882e070eaa6cdc39ee64f4","reviewer":"codex","start_line":40,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_amge7waad5cmhnq5koj7jeimpj"},"pull_request":{"number":959},"record_id":"art_v1_djs4yrk3mrhy35j4hfezyqt2tv","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-04T02:40:35Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
